From 15dd4347a1aa1af662d833517ad3edb429744996 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:52:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 13/14] XD hook: hash only the received bytes the program needs

From the compressed data to the end of the loader, so a changed header
byte or different padding after the loader doesn't stop the fix. The
decompressed program is still checked as a whole before anything is
changed. The emulator test covers that case and the 128 KiB block size
of the AMD board.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014JPQshc9oBXnzvR2E67Khm
